WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:05.480
To everyone watching this, please...

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:09.360
Please support my friends at DoRed.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:18.330
I'm sorry, Ran.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:20.580
Freeze.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.910
21:27 AUGUST 5, 2021

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.580
I said don't move.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.040
Ms. Shishido, I'll talk to him.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.590
You knew who I was.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.750
I know that you're not an accomplice.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.460
You left me to run free?

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.300
You're the one who deceived me first.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.300
How dare you do that to...

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.180
Are you all right, Koki?

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.260
Yes. Let's take him into custody.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:46.980
- Who is that?
- Open the window!

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:48.150
I'm sorry.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:49.900
Koki?

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:53.070
Kaoru, don't let them get away.
They went outside. After them!

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:53.900
S-Sure.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.410
See ya!

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.660
<i>Those must be his DoRed friends.</i>

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:05.080
<i>Naito Kudo, also known as Kunai.</i>

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.580
AUGUST 6, 2021

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:09.080
<i>Born in Shantytown, lived in Pylon Apartment.</i>

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:13.090
<i>One year older than Ran,</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.800
<i>and his best friend.</i>

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.640
<i>I vaguely recall seeing Kunai.</i>

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:22.600
Well done, Koki.

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:26.640
You prevented a terrorist attack.
Why don't you look more happy?

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:31.230
I can't be sitting on my laurels.
We haven't figured out his motives yet.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:36.320
The potential suspect who got away
was Ran Akagi?

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.360
Was he connected with the perp somehow?

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:40.490
<i>That sounds so forced.</i>

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:44.830
From circumstantial evidence, I can infer
that the chances of him being an accomplice is low.

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:47.830
Then why did he run away?

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.170
<i>To protect DoRed.</i>

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:53.050
<i>It's clear that there's a connection
between Naito to Ran.</i>

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:56.550
<i>DoRed has been violating
the Anti-Nuisance Ordinance again and again.</i>

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.840
<i>SARG would not hesitate
to crush the entire group.</i>

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:01.800
At any rate,
it was an attempted terrorist attack.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:05.720
We have to hear his side of the story.
Can you help us with... Oh?

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:08.600
I'll go take a look at the interrogation.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:15.650
You are under arrest for illegal drug use
in the presence of authorities.

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:20.030
Hey, give that back.
I can't calm down without it.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:21.030
Shut it, scumbag.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.740
You have the right to remain silent.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:30.790
Anything you say can and will be used against you
in a court of law. You have the...

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.170
It's all over the news,
so you know what we're talking about.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:33.540
Give us information
about this guy's buddies, DoRed.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.510
There's a possibility they're involved
in the development and distribution of Drug D.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:40.970
If you don't speak up,
you'll be treated as accomplices.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:45.260
Looks like things are getting real now.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:47.810
Shantytown is filled with SARG.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.520
They're after us, huh?

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.770
But Kunai was simply being used, right?

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.980
Then why don't we explain everything
we know to the SARG?

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.480
That's a waste of time.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:00.240
- Ran.
- How are you feeling?

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.870
Geez, calling us all out with this one text.

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.870
HELP!!
Seriously in danger
Place - Monorail Storage
Hurry but approach with caution!
Super secret

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.290
You're crossing too many dangerous bridges.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.040
You seriously saved me.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:11.790
But to be honest,
we still have a touch-and-go situation.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:15.290
How did the situation
turn into Kunai getting shot to death?

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.420
Yeah, why terrorism?

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:21.340
Kunai was set up
to become the developer of Drug-D

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.970
by the guys who want to demolish Shantytown
and turn it into a casino.

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:27.560
That's why he went after Howard's boat.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:31.440
Revenge out of desperation, so to say?

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.440
Though, it could've been for our sake.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.810
Damn it, Kunai.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.320
Why didn't he talk to us about it?

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.740
Who knows?

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.750
You're kidding me.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.540
Ran?

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:59.960
Hey, Mrs. Kudo. Can you tell us
a bit about your grandson Naito?

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.840
Why yes, Kunai is such a good boy.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:09.100
He was always so kind from when he was a child,
and good with machines.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:13.480
Oh, pardon me. Where is Kunai?

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.980
Mrs. Kudo, I told you that Naito...

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:20.480
<i>That Vision had no future
where we could've saved Kunai.</i>

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.650
<i>I believe I made the right decision.</i>

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:27.990
<i>And I don't know how it works, but the Visions
are all very similar to Hazard Cast.</i>

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.160
<i>I should just make a direct inquiry about this.</i>

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.500
Phone calls from Asumi?

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:37.290
Yes. It started back around May.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:42.380
Right before incidents occurred around me,
I kept getting phone calls from Asumi.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.430
I see.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:47.470
Father, do you have any knowledge about this?

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.100
- Does it have something with Hazard Cas—
- Koki.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:56.770
You will someday follow in my footsteps
and govern over the 24th Ward.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:00.360
Look at reality. Don't be trapped by the past.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:03.400
Step forward into the future.
You can do that, right?

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.700
Yes.

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:09.490
By the way,
I heard the reports about last night.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:11.660
You played a big part
in preventing a terrorist attack?

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.330
Well done.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:14.660
Yes.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.580
Hello, mayor's office.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:24.670
Why aren't Ran or Koki
answering their phones?

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.680
What? Did you have a fight or something?

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:28.970
Oh, Mari.

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.430
No, it's nothing like...

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.680
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:37.020
Oh no, it's just muscle cramps.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:38.850
Working out again?

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:44.190
Oh, is it true that DoRed had ties with
that attempted terrorist attack two nights ago?

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.780
Are Ran and Kinako okay?

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:50.160
Who knows? I'd like to know myself.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:53.490
Hey, both of you. Over here!

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.210
Mom, what's going on?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.870
Come watch the TV.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.580
<i>I repeat.</i>

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:03.500
<i>We received a statement from the perpetrator
of the attempted terrorist bombing two nights ago.</i>

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:08.050
<i>The bomber had previously set up a video
to be released today at noon.</i>

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.220
<i>We will be broadcasting it live.</i>

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.220
<i>It will begin momentarily.</i>

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:13.720
Huh? Already?

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.810
<i>This video has been set for a scheduled release.</i>

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:25.990
<i>If this is being broadcast, then that means
I've either been arrested by SARG,</i>

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.360
<i>or I am no longer alive.</i>

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:34.290
<i>My name is Naito Kudo.
Everyone calls me Kunai.</i>

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.870
<i>Drug D has been getting popular lately
in Shantytown.</i>

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:44.380
<i>I made it. Or rather,
I made the app that became the base for it.</i>

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:49.760
<i>CPhones have
powerful biometric sensors built-in.</i>

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:53.010
<i>Their performance is way beyond personal use.</i>

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:58.930
<i>I utilized that to create an app
that will have a positive effect on the mind.</i>

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:01.520
<i>That's the music app Di-VA.</i>

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:07.900
<i>However, someone bought its rights and
modified it to work directly on the human brain,</i>

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:11.160
<i>and made people act and behave strangely.</i>

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.030
<i>That's the truth behind Drug D.</i>

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:19.410
<i>Howard Win was aboard WINNER'S,
the boat that I targeted for the terrorist attack.</i>

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:26.000
<i>He pushed the distribution of Drug D to intentionally
ruin the peace and order of Shantytown</i>

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.920
<i>so he can move forward with redevelopment.</i>

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:36.510
<i>I don't know if my terrorist act succeeded or failed,
but I don't think I did anything wrong.</i>

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:42.690
<i>I'm sure information will be available soon,
so allow me to make one confession.</i>

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.440
<i>I used to be a part of DoRed.</i>

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:50.530
<i>So I'm pretty sure SARG will try harder
to keep DoRed under control.</i>

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:56.830
<i>But this case was something I did all alone.
It had nothing to do with DoRed.</i>

00:07:57.280 --> 00:08:03.330
<i>If you think the ward's politics are a bit too pushy...
If you want to protect Shantytown...</i>

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.710
<i>To everyone watching this, please...</i>

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:10.920
<i>Please support my friends at DoRed.</i>

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:17.220
<i>You're an artist, Ran.</i>

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.220
Message received, Kunai.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.310
Is everyone ready?

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:22.690
- Yup.
- Yes!

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.560
We'll do everything short of violence.

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:27.150
It's war against the ward office.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:29.230
Was that really the terrorist?

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.650
<i>We've just broadcast the statement from
the perpetrator of the attempted terrorist bombing.</i>

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.610
If he says so himself, why wouldn't he be?

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.490
Those guys. So that's what this is about.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:35.870
It's true that the ward's policies are a bit
too aggressive, but can we really believe this?

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:37.530
Welcom—

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.870
Sorry, Kiriko, I'm gonna clock out for today.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.290
Huh? You were goofing off earlier, too.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.540
FEEL FREE TO TAKE

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.790
I want to go eat lunch, you know?

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:46.040
Shu.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:47.790
Here!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.130
A souvenir.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.050
You need it, right?

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.220
Yeah, you're right. Thank you.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:03.560
<i>He used the incident against us.
Now SARG is the villain.</i>

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.850
I'm cancelling all plans for this afternoon.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:07.350
A-All right.

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.190
Father?

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.730
Come with me, Koki.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:13.320
I will show you the future of the 24th Ward.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.450
Can the destination possibly be...

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:26.960
The information accumulation
radio tower, Cornucopia.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:33.340
Once complete, it will become a monument
symbolic of the 24th Ward, no, all of Japan.

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:43.720
This is the lowest floor of the Special Administrative
Region Central Information Center.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:46.850
So this is the core of Hazard Cast?

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:51.360
Even in the 24th Ward, only a selected few
are aware of its location.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.400
This is top secret material.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:02.540
I've been waiting for you.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:04.500
Tsuzuragawa.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:08.670
This is the location of Hazard Cast's roots.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:17.880
As you're aware, sensors within the 24th Ward
are mainly surveillance cameras.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:21.430
But we gather and analyze
an immense amount of data from them

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:26.230
to broadcast Hazard Cast that protects
the people's safety, to their cPhones.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:32.900
That is the KANAE System that uses this
Next Generation Macroscopic Complex Computer.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:34.440
Did you say KANAE?

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:38.650
That's right. It is named
after your mother, Mrs. Kanae.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:42.990
Before she left for her new post
in Takara Elementary School,

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.790
she had been researching smart cities.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:50.040
The foundation of the KANAE System
has been developed by Mrs. Kanae.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:54.800
Her last wish is what supports
the current safety of the 24th Ward.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.720
And by maintaining the peace and order,

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:01.220
we will enter a new generation
by adding information from cPhones

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.510
that were distributed to the ward residents.

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:10.190
Koki, I will show you the special BRAIN
that is the root of the KANAE System.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.440
A special BRAIN?

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.910
Is this...

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:31.000
High-performance sensors used by the military,
and a powerful security chip...

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.540
Unbelievable.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.590
Saying this is below cost doesn't even cut it.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:39.590
You have to be hiding
some kind of secret, huh, Gori Suido?

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.680
<i>Hey there. Ran, open up.</i>

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:45.390
Yoo-hoo.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:48.600
Don't yoo-hoo me.
Why aren't you answering the phone?

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.190
Oh, this turned into that.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:57.530
Hey, are cPhones bad after all?

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.780
Did Drug D really spread because of this?

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.530
Shu, you saw Kunai's broadcast?

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:04.370
Yeah.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.620
He looked somewhat familiar.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:10.200
You've met him a few times in the past.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.920
Hey, do you think Carneades is framing us?

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:19.420
Maybe he's pressuring us
to make one choice or another,

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:22.800
and leading us into a situation where there's
always a casualty, just to toy with us?

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:26.050
Are you saying he's predicting
our future behavior as well?

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.010
Then what does Asumin have to do with it?

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:31.060
Shu, you're the one who said Asumin
is calling to us for help.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.350
Well...

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.730
It's best if you don't come here anymore.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:37.610
Why?

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:40.190
Kunai said what he said in that video earlier,

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:44.280
but SARG will definitely
give one excuse or another to come after us.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:47.070
And Ko knows about this location.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:51.330
Wh-What are you talking about?
Are you saying Koki will sell you out?

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:52.710
Probably.

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:55.500
We're RGB when all three of us are together.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:58.630
If we're split like this,
what're we gonna say to Asumi or Kaba?

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.630
Make sure to fix that phone.

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.760
I'll make Koki call you
and promise he'll never betray us.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:06.180
See ya. You can eat that
and get in better spirits.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.940
Ko will sell us out.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:21.150
Thanks for your usual patronage.

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.690
NANBA FRUITS AND VEGETABLES

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:22.860
I got some good stuff,
so please take your time.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:25.780
Oh, the one I bought the other day
was really tasty.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.410
It was so ripe.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:28.990
That's why it sold so well.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.160
You're speaking nonsense again.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.750
Your son doing well?

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:37.250
He's fine. Full of energy, but so cheeky.

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:39.710
Thief!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.090
- Crap.
- Hold it!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.890
- Goodness, what's going on here?
- Let me go!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.850
- A thief! Please call SARG.
- Damn it!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.310
I finally found you.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.690
Hey, Shuta.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.400
You should pick up your phone.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.660
Sorry. I forgot to call back.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:09.910
That's not like you.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.910
Like me, huh?

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.700
This brings back memories.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.000
I hear the school is being taken down?

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:23.550
I'm also going to be here as an observer
as a member of SARG.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.260
Feels a bit lonely.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:29.800
It's more like a miracle that it lasted this long.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.140
We have to break it down at some point.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.720
Will everything change?

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:38.560
The school... 24th Ward... Even us.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.060
Of course.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:46.280
Ran is the leader of DoRed.
Koki, you're a part of SARG. I am....

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.070
...the son of a baker.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.490
We all have different positions,
but we're friends, right?

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:56.040
What we like, what we hate,
what we can't stomach, what we believe in.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.250
We're friends
who understand each other, right?

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:01.710
I forsook and killed Ran's friend.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.130
How can I ever face him again?

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:09.220
If we go to Yumihariyu, drink milk together,
and I tell him "Sorry, that was bad of me,”

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.050
will we go back to how we were?

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.090
We can.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.720
Shuta, every time, you're so—

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:15.810
Like I care.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:18.430
Asumi doesn't want us to be this way, either.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.770
But that Asumi is no longer with us.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.650
We've already changed.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.940
It's not like the time when we were kids.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:33.910
Mom!

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:36.290
I caught a thief.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.910
Yes, you're such a good boy.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:43.380
I'm going to go listen to Ran's story,
so can both of you wait here?

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.550
So Ran, can you tell us?

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:53.550
He stole all that stuff
yet he's not feeling sorry.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:56.390
I wonder if he wanted a lot of apples.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:59.810
That was indeed too many to eat alone.

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.560
I'll tell you.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:06.980
Class 3-1, student number 1, Shuta Aoi...

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:09.110
is on the scene.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:14.950
Are you friends with Ran Akagi?

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.080
No, not really.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:21.410
But the people in Shantytown sometimes
come to our bakery for free bread crusts.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:25.500
So I wondered if this was the case.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:30.510
Hey guys, let's all eat together.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.100
Big Brother, let's eat, yeah?

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.850
Oh. Okay.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.190
Tasty, huh?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:50.690
Yeah.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:57.160
So this is where both of you were.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:00.450
Mother, u-um...

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:06.710
Did I make a mistake?
He was doing that for his hungry friends.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.590
You didn't make a mistake.
You did what was right.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.760
However, nothing in this world is perfect.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:22.430
If you try to do something right in hopes
of saving someone, you'll clash with some rules.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.770
Just like what Ran did today.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:29.150
Sometimes people step outside of the rules
during times like that.

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:32.900
Doing something like that
takes a lot of courage.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.950
But is that really the right thing to do?

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.910
What if you're wrong?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:41.910
Listen to me.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:48.210
What's important is for everyone
to keep thinking about what is right, together.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.630
Now, let's go home.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:59.430
AUGUST 8, 2021

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:04.100
<i>To correct a mistaken rule,
you make an effort to overstep that rule.</i>

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:07.310
<i>There's truth behind Ran's sense of justice.</i>

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:09.560
<i>That's what I'd been thinking all this time.</i>

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.360
<i>But that's a thing of the past now.</i>

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:22.950
The other day, terrorist planted a bomb aboard
the WINNER'S. I was on that boat as well.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.750
The incident was prevented before it happened.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:32.750
What assisted the Special Administrative
Region Guard and saved our lives was Hazard Cast.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:40.850
By analyzing information from
surveillance cameras all over the 24th Ward,

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:43.060
a crime had been preemptively prevented.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:46.100
However, its accuracy
is still a work in progress.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:51.110
To expand what it can do is a proposition
for all of us who live in these times.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:56.940
Therefore, right here and now,
for the complete prevention of crime and disasters,

00:18:56.940 --> 00:19:01.320
even surpassing that of Hazard Cast,
I propose to you the KANAE System.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:07.200
I will go into the details
about the new system a bit later.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:10.620
But first, for everyone feeling uneasy
about incorporating the new system,

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:14.460
I'd like to announce that its incorporation
will take place in several steps.

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:17.970
The first step will be a test run
to the end of this year.

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:23.010
Afterwards, we will hold a ward referendum
to determine if this system is right for us or not.

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.470
Updates will begin today, as of this time.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.980
I'd like everyone to test it out
to the best of your abilities

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:31.310
<i>so you're prepared
for the election in December.</i>

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:35.770
<i>There was a surprising announcement
from Mayor Suido just now.</i>

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:34.570
A referendum, huh?

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:36.360
Here you go, a Mari-Special.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:40.030
Summer Vacation Memories,
Research Project Special.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:45.580
Oh, you can eat this stag beetle,
as well as the tree and its sap.

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:46.830
Hey Mari.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:50.000
<i>Today's Mari-Special is another miss.</i>

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:55.840
This thing called the KANAE System?
How does thing change from what it is now?

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.760
A ward referendum?

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:00.550
I don't think they can do this
in a forthright manner.

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:03.340
Here it comes already.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:06.560
To assist Hazard Cast, the safety predictor of 24th Ward,
will you contribute information to the KANAE System?
[Agree] [Later]

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.270
Is this...

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:11.390
What's this?

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:14.270
Update? For our safety?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:19.530
All information will be encrypted?
How much of this can we believe?

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:22.660
To assist Hazard Cast, the safety predictor of 24th Ward,
will you contribute information to the KANAE System?
[Agree] [Later]

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:22.240
I'll never update.

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:23.780
Other people have also searched for...
kunai person terrorist
kunai person DORED
kunai person terrorist threat
kunai person face

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.410
Kunai said that it was dangerous.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.120
This is for our safety, right?

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.000
I wonder if I should help out.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:36.540
Giving up a bit of privacy
is a small price to buy safety.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.000
It'd be too late after something happens.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.380
You're right.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:44.470
What are you going to do, Shu?
They'll be able to protect everyone's safety.

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:45.680
I know that.

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:49.430
But something about it
rubs me the wrong way.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:55.860
There was a terrorist statement the other day
that sensors built into cPhones were dangerous.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:59.280
That was nothing more
than groundless fake news.

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:01.690
We have already submitted
detailed data regarding this.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:07.410
Encrypted information gathered by cPhones
are analyzed using a next-generation computer,

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:11.040
and exponentially increases the efficacy
of Hazard Cast's predictions.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:14.830
It will now be possible
to preemptively stop a crime from happening.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:18.170
The KANAE System is an extraordinary
quantum computer

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:23.670
that can store, scan, and utilize
an immense amount of data.

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:27.300
To allow for such a vast amount
of arithmetic processing possible,

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:31.850
there's a forbidden technology,
which is what we'll show you now.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:40.190
Koki, that hellish agony we suffered
when we lost our loved ones...

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:44.240
Don't you think something like that
is not needed in this world?

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:48.620
Tragedies like that of Kanae and Asumi
must be eradicated.

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.950
We need a perfect world.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:56.580
And someone must be the sacrifice
to pay the price.

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:05.340
This is the BRAIN of the KANAE System.

00:22:09.600 --> 00:22:11.600
Th-This means...

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:16.020
You connected your own daughter
to a machine like this?

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:19.060
Asumi... Is Asumi still alive?

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:20.560
She’s dead.

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:23.530
That's why I was able to make this decision.

00:22:23.730 --> 00:22:28.950
This is simply a brain as a mechanical part,
and a physical body to balance it out.

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:35.450
Our safety is built upon Kanae's logic
and Asumi's sacrifice as its foundation.

00:22:36.210 --> 00:22:39.120
In order to contribute something
to the world,

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:41.960
we need to prepare ourselves
with a broad mind to tolerate good and evil.

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:44.960
It is time to make your decision, Koki.

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:48.970
I want to hear you declare it.

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:47.840
<i>I...</i>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:51.300
DoRed's leader.

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:53.600
The identity of Red.

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:55.470
Who is it?

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:03.360
Run!

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:09.410
<i>I knew it. God damn it.</i>

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:15.620
Friendships are so fleeting.

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:24.460
Mother, Asumi.

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:27.630
The perfect world is within reach.

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:36.140
Mrs. Kanae.

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:40.520
Please forgive my sinful self.

00:23:46.030 --> 00:23:50.610
Every act of Creation
is an act of Destruction.
